      "id": "world-book-of-pores:tut-enter",
      "title": "Opening the World Book",
      "steps": [
        "The World Book records every campaign with the same telemetry contract. The base campaign, Pore Explorer and Midnight Clinic all report into it.",
        "Records are integers and definitions are versioned, so a record set today means the same thing later.",
        "Daily disasters and weekly championships are generated from the UTC date and the installed content. They work offline.",
        "Legendary encounters and gauntlets are ordinary appointments with extraordinary settings. Share codes recreate them locally."
